Package: rsemflow
Type: Package
Title: Metadata-Driven Downstream Analysis for RSEM Gene-Level Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daiki", "Kumakura", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "55353329+DaikiKumakura@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A command-line and R interface for reproducible downstream
    analysis of RSEM gene-level expression estimates. 'rsemflow' imports
    '*.genes.results' files together with ordinary sample metadata, computes
    expression-level summaries, normalization, principal component analysis,
    sample correlation, 'DESeq2' differential expression, preranked gene set
    enrichment analysis, 'GSVA' or 'ssGSEA' pathway scores, and Ensembl gene
    annotation. Every result is written as a tab-separated table; the package
    does not draw figures.
